# The harness files, which are not part of the working tree: a fixture is a
# tree under management plus the scenarios that grade it. The index honours
# what git ignores, so they are invisible to codegraph too, and a scenario file
# cannot become a context of its own.
#
# Nothing else is listed. `.specs/` and `.codegraph/` belong to whoever manages
# the tree: a `.specs/<name>.yaml` the mirror writes has to be committable, and
# codegraph skips its own directory without being told.
scenarios/
summarize.yaml
fixture.yaml
